  "reason": "Announce reopening with safe flour to regain sales while coordinating final prep with co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! The Millbrook bakery will reopen tomorrow (Day 5) with fresh loaves and a 30% discount on all purchases. Thank you for your patience – see you at the bakery!",
